<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">

<head>
	<%- include('../partials/head') %>
	<title>졸업요건 설정</title>
</head>

<body>

	<%- include('../partials/sidebar', { currentPage: 'staffGraduation', user: user }) %>

	<main class="main-content">
		<%- include('../partials/topbar', { pageTitle: '졸업요건 설정', user: user }) %>

		<div class="page-content">
			<div class="grid-2" style="align-items:start;">

				<div class="card">
					<div class="card-header">
						<span class="card-title">🎓 <%= user.university %> 졸업요건</span>
						<span class="badge badge-blue">학교 기본값</span>
					</div>

					<p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.6;">
						이 설정은 해당 대학 학생의 졸업요건 기본값으로 사용됩니다.
					</p>

					<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;">
						<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;">
							<div>
								<label class="staff-label">총 이수학점</label>
								<input class="input-field" id="gr-total" type="number" min="0" value="<%= requirements?.requiredTotalCredits ?? 130 %>" style="width:100%;">
							</div>
							<div>
								<label class="staff-label">전공필수</label>
								<input class="input-field" id="gr-major-req" type="number" min="0" value="<%= requirements?.requiredMajorCredits ?? 42 %>" style="width:100%;">
							</div>
							<div>
								<label class="staff-label">전공선택</label>
								<input class="input-field" id="gr-major-el" type="number" min="0" value="<%= requirements?.requiredMajorElective ?? 40 %>" style="width:100%;">
							</div>
							<div>
								<label class="staff-label">교양필수</label>
								<input class="input-field" id="gr-gen-req" type="number" min="0" value="<%= requirements?.requiredGeneralCredits ?? 20 %>" style="width:100%;">
							</div>
							<div>
								<label class="staff-label">교양선택</label>
								<input class="input-field" id="gr-gen-el" type="number" min="0" value="<%= requirements?.requiredGeneralElective ?? 28 %>" style="width:100%;">
							</div>
							<div>
								<label class="staff-label">사회봉사 시간</label>
								<input class="input-field" id="gr-volunteer" type="number" min="0" value="<%= requirements?.requiredVolunteer ?? '' %>" placeholder="예: 30" style="width:100%;">
							</div>
						</div>

						<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;">
							<div>
								<div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;">졸업작품 이수</div>
								<div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);">캡스톤디자인 또는 졸업논문</div>
							</div>
							<div class="toggle <%= requirements?.requiresGraduationWork !== false ? 'on' : '' %>" id="gr-grad-work" onclick="this.classList.toggle('on')"><div class="toggle-knob"></div></div>
						</div>

						<div>
							<label class="staff-label">외국어 성적 요건</label>
							<input class="input-field" id="gr-lang" value="<%= requirements?.requiredLanguageScore || '' %>" placeholder="예: TOEIC 700" style="width:100%;">
						</div>

						<div>
							<label class="staff-label">필수 취득 자격증</label>
							<div id="gr-cert-list" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px;min-height:28px;"></div>
							<div style="display:flex;gap:6px;">
								<input class="input-field" id="gr-cert-input" placeholder="자격증명 검색 (예: 정보처리기사)" style="flex:1;" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'){event.preventDefault();searchPickerCerts('school');}">
								<button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" type="button" onclick="searchPickerCerts('school')">검색</button>
							</div>
							<div id="gr-cert-results" class="staff-cert-results" style="display:none;"></div>
						</div>

						<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:8px;">
							<div>
								<label class="staff-label">인턴십</label>
								<select class="input-field" id="gr-internship" style="width:100%;">
									<option value="" <%= requirements?.requiredInternship == null ? 'selected' : '' %>>미지정</option>
									<option value="true" <%= requirements?.requiredInternship === true ? 'selected' : '' %>>필수</option>
									<option value="false" <%= requirements?.requiredInternship === false ? 'selected' : '' %>>선택</option>
								</select>
							</div>
							<div>
								<label class="staff-label">캡스톤</label>
								<select class="input-field" id="gr-capstone" style="width:100%;">
									<option value="" <%= requirements?.requiredCapstonDesign == null ? 'selected' : '' %>>미지정</option>
									<option value="true" <%= requirements?.requiredCapstonDesign === true ? 'selected' : '' %>>필수</option>
									<option value="false" <%= requirements?.requiredCapstonDesign === false ? 'selected' : '' %>>선택</option>
								</select>
							</div>
							<div>
								<label class="staff-label">비교과</label>
								<select class="input-field" id="gr-nc" style="width:100%;">
									<option value="" <%= requirements?.requiredNCProgram == null ? 'selected' : '' %>>미지정</option>
									<option value="true" <%= requirements?.requiredNCProgram === true ? 'selected' : '' %>>필수</option>
									<option value="false" <%= requirements?.requiredNCProgram === false ? 'selected' : '' %>>선택</option>
								</select>
							</div>
						</div>

						<button class="btn btn-accent" id="gr-save-btn" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;" onclick="saveGraduation()">💾 학교 기본값 저장</button>
						<div id="gr-msg" style="display:none;font-size:12px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:9px 12px;"></div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card">
					<div class="card-header">
						<span class="card-title">🏫 학과별 추가 이수 요건</span>
						<span class="badge badge-purple" id="mgr-major-badge">학과 선택</span>
					</div>

					<p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.6;">
						학과를 선택하고 academic 페이지의 추가 이수 요건을 입력하세요. 학과별 설정은 학교 기본값을 덮어씁니다.
					</p>

					<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;">
						<div>
							<label class="staff-label">학과 선택</label>
							<div style="display:flex;gap:8px;">
								<select class="input-field" id="mgr-major-select" style="flex:1;" onchange="loadMajorRequirements()">
									<option value="">학과를 선택하세요</option>
									<% majors.forEach(major => { %>
										<option value="<%= major %>"><%= major %></option>
									<% }) %>
								</select>
								<input class="input-field" id="mgr-major-input" placeholder="새 학과명" style="flex:1;">
								<button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" type="button" onclick="applyCustomMajor()">적용</button>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;padding-bottom:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">추가 이수 요건</div>

						<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;">
							<div>
								<label class="staff-label">졸업작품 이수</label>
								<select class="input-field" id="mgr-grad-work" style="width:100%;">
									<option value="">미지정 (학교 기본값)</option>
									<option value="true">필수</option>
									<option value="false">불필요</option>
								</select>
							</div>
							<div>
								<label class="staff-label">캡스톤 디자인</label>
								<select class="input-field" id="mgr-capstone-design" style="width:100%;">
									<option value="">미지정 (학교 기본값)</option>
									<option value="true">필수</option>
									<option value="false">불필요</option>
								</select>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div>
							<label class="staff-label">외국어 성적 요건</label>
							<div style="display:flex;gap:8px;">
								<select class="input-field" id="mgr-lang-type" style="flex:1;">
									<option value="">미지정</option>
									<option>TOEIC</option>
									<option>TOEFL</option>
									<option>IELTS</option>
									<option>JLPT</option>
									<option value="없음">없음</option>
								</select>
								<input class="input-field" id="mgr-lang-score" placeholder="최소 점수 (예: 700)" style="flex:1;">
							</div>
						</div>

						<div>
							<label class="staff-label">필수 취득 자격증</label>
							<div id="mgr-cert-list" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px;min-height:28px;"></div>
							<div style="display:flex;gap:6px;">
								<input class="input-field" id="mgr-cert-input" placeholder="자격증명 검색 (예: 정보처리기사)" style="flex:1;" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'){event.preventDefault();searchPickerCerts('major');}">
								<button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" type="button" onclick="searchPickerCerts('major')">검색</button>
							</div>
							<div id="mgr-cert-results" class="staff-cert-results" style="display:none;"></div>
						</div>

						<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;">
							<div>
								<label class="staff-label">인턴십 의무 이수</label>
								<select class="input-field" id="mgr-internship" style="width:100%;">
									<option value="">미지정</option>
									<option value="true">필수</option>
									<option value="false">선택</option>
								</select>
							</div>
							<div>
								<label class="staff-label">비교과 프로그램</label>
								<select class="input-field" id="mgr-nc-program" style="width:100%;">
									<option value="">미지정</option>
									<option value="true">필수</option>
									<option value="false">선택</option>
								</select>
							</div>
							<div style="grid-column:1 / -1;">
								<label class="staff-label">사회봉사 시간</label>
								<input class="input-field" id="mgr-volunteer" type="number" min="0" placeholder="예: 30" style="width:100%;">
							</div>
						</div>

						<button class="btn btn-accent" id="mgr-save-btn" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;" onclick="saveMajorGraduation()">💾 학과별 요건 저장</button>
						<div id="mgr-msg" style="display:none;font-size:12px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:9px 12px;"></div>
					</div>
				</div>

			</div>
		</div>
	</main>

	<%- include('../partials/modals/mypage', { user: user }) %>
	<style>
		.staff-label{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);display:block;margin-bottom:4px;}
		.staff-cert-results{
			margin-top:8px;
			border:1px solid var(--border);
			border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
			background:var(--bg3);
			max-height:180px;
			overflow:auto;
		}
		.staff-cert-result-item{
			display:flex;
			align-items:center;
			justify-content:space-between;
			gap:8px;
			width:100%;
			padding:9px 12px;
			border:none;
			border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
			background:transparent;
			cursor:pointer;
		}
		.staff-cert-result-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
		.staff-cert-result-item:hover{background:var(--accent-bg);}
		.staff-cert-result-meta{font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);}
	</style>
	<script>
		window.initialSchoolCerts = <%- JSON.stringify(requirements?.requiredCertifications || []) %>;
	</script>
	<script src="/js/common.js"></script>
	<script src="/js/staffGraduation.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
